#. phantasmExamSections.reverse-archives.title
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:27
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamSections.reverse-archives.title"
msgid "Reverse-Side Historiography"
msgstr "反面史料學"

#. phantasmExamSections.reverse-archives.note
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:28
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamSections.reverse-archives.note"
msgid "Do not choose the more convenient world from mutually exclusive records."
msgstr "不替互相排斥的紀錄選一個較順眼的世界。"

#. phantasmExamSections.boundary-logic.title
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:33
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamSections.boundary-logic.title"
msgid "Boundary and Contradiction Reasoning"
msgstr "邊界與矛盾推理"

#. phantasmExamSections.boundary-logic.note
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:34
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamSections.boundary-logic.note"
msgid "A contradiction may be retained; it may not license an arbitrary conclusion."
msgstr "矛盾可以被保存，但不得因此推出任何想要的結論。"

#. phantasmExamSections.untaken-causality.title
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:39
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamSections.untaken-causality.title"
msgid "Untaken Causality and Record Boundaries"
msgstr "未行因果與學籍邊界"

#. phantasmExamSections.untaken-causality.note
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:40
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamSections.untaken-causality.note"
msgid ""
"Dreams may retain unchosen branches; simulations may not impersonate waking "
"counterfactuals."
msgstr "夢能保存未選分支，不能把模擬結果冒充醒著時的反事實。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:49
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.3"
msgid ""
"[One file: TU-I-17]\nFront, 14:00: closure adopts hypothesis A; B is excluded "
"for lack of a windway log.\nReverse, after the ninth strike: B becomes dream "
"history and cites the 'missing windway log' as evidence that the record was "
"eaten."
msgstr ""
"【同一案卷 TU-I-17】\n正面・14:00：結案採用甲說；乙說因風路紀錄缺失而被排除。\n反面・第九響後：乙說被編為夢境正史，並把『缺失的風路紀錄』列"
"作遭吞食的證據。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.4
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:50
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.4"
msgid ""
"Which catalogue treatment preserves the reverse source without rewriting the "
"completed official closure?"
msgstr "哪一種編目方式既保存反面史料，又不改寫已完成的正式結案？"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.5.0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:52
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.5.0"
msgid ""
"Replace the official closure because the reverse is later, mark the original "
"obsolete, and reuse its source number to preserve apparent traceability"
msgstr "以反面日期較晚為由取代正式結案，把原案卷標作過期版本，並沿用原來源編號以維持表面可追溯性"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.5.1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:53
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.5.1"
msgid ""
"Append B as an official correction while retaining A's score and closure "
"time, reducing the reverse marker to an internal grader note"
msgstr "把乙說附加為正式訂正，保留甲說分數與結案時間不變，並把反面標記縮成只供內部閱卷者識別的備註"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.5.2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:54
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.5.2"
msgid ""
"Keep official closure and dream edition separately, link both to the same "
"source, and mark their incompatible validity boundaries"
msgstr "分存正式結案與夢境版本，連回同一來源，並標明兩者互不通用的有效邊界"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.5.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:55
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.5.3"
msgid ""
"Merge A and B as 'partly supported' to avoid opposing conclusions, attaching "
"both summaries and their shared source number without identifying front or "
"reverse"
msgstr "把甲乙兩說合成『部分成立』，以免同一案卷留下相反結論；另附兩份摘要與共同來源編號，但不再標明哪一份屬正面或反面"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.7
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:58
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.0.PH-R01.7"
msgid ""
"PHANTASM does not retry the case for the dream. It gives an excluded branch "
"a traceable place; sources may be shared, validity boundaries may not be "
"swapped."
msgstr "PHANTASM 的工作不是替夢翻案，而是讓被排除分支有可追溯的位置；來源可以共用，效力邊界不可偷換。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:64
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.3"
msgid ""
"[Before and after dream consumption]\n08:58: the reverse paragraph has "
"checksum K9-441; two graders copy it independently.\n09:00: Doremy "
"acknowledges eating that dream.\n09:01: its location is blank; the front "
"record never contained the paragraph."
msgstr ""
"【食夢前後】\n08:58：反面段落有校驗碼 K9-441，兩名閱卷者各自抄錄。\n09:00：多蕾米承認吃掉該段夢。\n09:01：原位置變成空白；正面紀錄"
"從未包含這一段。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.4
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:65
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.4"
msgid "What is the most rigorous interpretation of the blank at 09:01?"
msgstr "對 09:01 的空白，最嚴謹的判讀是？"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.5.0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:67
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.5.0"
msgid ""
"Retain the pre-consumption snapshot and consumption event, treating the "
"blank as mechanism-linked missingness rather than proof the paragraph never "
"existed"
msgstr "保留食夢前快照與食夢事件，把空白視為有已知機制的缺失，而非段落從未存在"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.5.1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:68
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.5.1"
msgid ""
"Treat the current blank as the highest version and revoke both copies "
"because reverse content should not outlive its page"
msgstr "以目前空白為最高版本，撤銷兩份抄錄，因為反面內容不應比紙面活得更久"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.5.2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:69
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.5.2"
msgid ""
"Reconstruct the full text from both graders and label it the pre-consumption "
"original rather than a derivative copy"
msgstr "依兩名閱卷者記憶重建全文，並把重建稿標為食夢前原件而非衍生抄本"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.5.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:70
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.5.3"
msgid ""
"Count Doremy's acknowledgment as a third matching copy and use a three-vote "
"majority to establish the wording"
msgstr "把多蕾米的承認當作第三份內容相同的抄本，用三票多數證明段落文字無誤"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.7
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:73
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.1.PH-R02.7"
msgid ""
"An observed deletion mechanism changes what a blank means. Consumption "
"supports prior existence followed by missingness, but supplies no new "
"verbatim evidence of the lost text."
msgstr "可觀察的刪失機制會改變空白的意義。食夢事件支持『曾有內容而後缺失』，但不替缺失文字提供新的逐字證據。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:79
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.3"
msgid ""
"[Yakumo boundary notice]\nFront: no passage after the ninth strike.\nReverse: "
"passage only after the ninth strike.\nThe page turns itself at 09:00; the "
"candidate crosses at 09:02 and wakes at 09:04 with the front showing again."
msgstr ""
"【八雲邊界告示】\n正面：第九響後不得通行。\n反面：只在第九響後准予通行。\n09:00 紙張自行翻面；考生於 09:02 穿過，09:04 "
"醒來後告示又在正面。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.4
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:80
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.4"
msgid "Which passage record is sufficient to reproduce the decision?"
msgstr "哪一條通行紀錄足以重現判定？"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.5.0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:82
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.5.0"
msgid ""
"Record legal passage at 09:02; once crossed, the side shown after waking "
"cannot affect validity"
msgstr "記為 09:02 合法通行；既然已通過，醒來後顯示哪一面不影響告示效力"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.5.1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:83
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.5.1"
msgid ""
"Mark the notice self-contradictory and void both rules, retaining only that "
"the candidate reached the other side"
msgstr "記為告示自相矛盾，故兩面規則同時失效；只保留考生確曾抵達另一側"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.5.2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:84
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.5.2"
msgid ""
"Use the 09:04 front as final, retroactively mark 09:02 unlawful, and retain "
"the turn time only as a display fault that cannot alter validity"
msgstr "以 09:04 正面為最終版本，回溯判定 09:02 屬違規；另保存翻面時間，但只當作不改變規則效力的顯示故障"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.5.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:85
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.5.3"
msgid ""
"Record wording, page side, turn event, crossing time, and applicable "
"boundary; judge 09:02 only within that condition set"
msgstr "記錄告示文字、正反面、翻面事件、通行時點與適用邊界；只在該組條件內判定 09:02"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.7
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:88
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.2.PH-R03.7"
msgid ""
"The proposition's truth depends on side and time. Saving only the sentence "
"or final display loses the boundary actually in force."
msgstr "命題的真假依賴頁面側與時間；只保存句子或最後畫面，都會遺失當時真正適用的邊界。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:94
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.3"
msgid ""
"[Non-explosion rule] A contradiction remains inside the file that produced "
"it and cannot entail an unrelated proposition.\nFront record: candidate "
"enrolled in PH-009.\nReverse record: candidate never enrolled in "
"PH-009.\nLibrary file: evidence is insufficient on whether LIB-NULL opens "
"today."
msgstr ""
"【不爆炸規則】矛盾只能留在產生它的案卷，不得用來推出無關命題。\n正面學籍：考生已選 PH-009。\n反面學籍：考生從未選 "
"PH-009。\n圖書館案卷：LIB-NULL 今日是否開館，資料不足。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.4
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:95
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.4"
msgid "Which conclusion is valid under the rule?"
msgstr "依規則，哪個結論有效？"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.5.0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:97
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.5.0"
msgid ""
"Because PH-009 is both enrolled and unenrolled, any course state follows, "
"including LIB-NULL opening today"
msgstr "PH-009 同時已選與未選，所以任何課程狀態都可成立，包括 LIB-NULL 今日開館"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.5.1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:98
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.5.1"
msgid ""
"The records conflict locally about PH-009; absent new library evidence, "
"LIB-NULL remains undetermined"
msgstr "兩份學籍對 PH-009 發生局部衝突；在沒有圖書館新證據前，LIB-NULL 仍維持資料不足"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.5.2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:99
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.5.2"
msgid ""
"Because the front is official, every reverse proposition is false; LIB-NULL "
"should inherit that day's ordinary-library hours and duty rules"
msgstr "正面屬正式學籍，因此反面命題一律為假；LIB-NULL 也應沿用正面校區普通圖書館的同日開館表與值班規則"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.5.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:100
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.5.3"
msgid ""
"Because the reverse is PHANTASM, contradiction itself is true; LIB-NULL may "
"be open and closed at once, with service chosen by arrival side"
msgstr "反面屬 PHANTASM，因此矛盾本身是真；規則既承認矛盾，LIB-NULL 便可同時開館與閉館，再以考生抵達側決定服務"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.7
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:103
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.3.PH-B01.7"
msgid ""
"Non-explosive reasoning preserves a local inconsistency without turning it "
"into a blank cheque. The library question still needs its own evidence."
msgstr "非爆炸推理允許局部保留不一致，卻禁止把它變成無限張空白支票。圖書館問題仍需自己的證據。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:109
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.3"
msgid ""
"[Clock version chain]\nK1 original: before → ninth → after.\nK2 reverse: "
"before → never; metadata says it was produced by erasing K1's middle at the "
"ninth strike.\nK3 summary calls K1 and K2 observations from two independent "
"clocks."
msgstr ""
"【鐘表版本鏈】\nK1 原始紀錄：before → ninth → after。\nK2 反面紀錄：before → never；元資料標註『由 K1 "
"在第九響時擦除中段而成』。\nK3 摘要把 K1、K2 稱作兩名獨立鐘表的觀測。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.4
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:110
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.4"
msgid "How should K3 be assessed?"
msgstr "應如何評價 K3？"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.5.0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:112
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.5.0"
msgid ""
"K1 and K2 differ, so they count as independent replication; derivation "
"affects only storage format"
msgstr "K1、K2 結論不同，足以視為獨立重現；生成方式只影響保存格式"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.5.1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:113
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.5.1"
msgid "K2 has less information but remains independent; K3 need only down-weight it"
msgstr "K2 缺少中段，資訊較少但仍是獨立觀測；K3 只需降低 K2 權重"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.5.2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:114
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.5.2"
msgid ""
"K2's never shows that K1's ninth is hindsight bias, so K2 should correct K1; "
"then count corrected K1 and K2 as two independent observations confirming "
"each other"
msgstr "K2 出現 never，表示 K1 的 ninth 屬後見偏差；應用 K2 訂正 K1，再把訂正後的 K1 與 K2 計作兩次互相印證的獨立觀測"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.5.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:115
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.5.3"
msgid ""
"K2 is a transformed descendant of K1, not a second observation; K3 must "
"retain the derivation edge and withdraw the replication claim"
msgstr "K2 是 K1 的變換後代，不是第二觀測；K3 必須保留衍生邊並撤回獨立重現主張"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.7
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:118
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.4.PH-B02.7"
msgid ""
"Different content does not imply independent provenance. PHANTASM must ask "
"whether 'never happened' was observed or manufactured by erasure."
msgstr "不同內容不等於獨立來源。PHANTASM 尤其要追蹤『沒有發生』是被觀測到，還是由擦除操作生成。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:124
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.3"
msgid ""
"[Circular publications]\nFirst edition: 'Paper cancelled; see ninth "
"edition.'\nNinth edition: 'Cancellation is true because the queue vanished "
"after the first edition.'\nCorrection: issued because the first edition "
"disrupted the queue, citing the ninth edition as proof cancellation was "
"already effective.\nGate log: candidates were admitted throughout."
msgstr ""
"【刊物互引】\n初版：『試卷已取消，詳見第九版。』\n第九版：『取消屬實，因初版刊出後隊伍消失。』\n訂正：因初版造成排隊混亂才發布，並引用第九版證明取消早已"
"生效。\n門禁 log：全時段持續放行考生。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.4
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:125
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.4"
msgid "What is the best evidence-graph conclusion?"
msgstr "最合適的證據圖結論是？"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.5.0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:127
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.5.0"
msgid ""
"The three publications form a dependency cycle and cannot independently "
"support one another; cancellation must be judged from out-of-cycle evidence "
"such as the gate log"
msgstr "三份刊物形成循環相依，不能互作獨立支持；取消狀態應回到門禁 log 等循環外來源判定"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.5.1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:128
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.5.1"
msgid ""
"The correction is latest and therefore authoritative; citing the ninth "
"edition breaks the cycle originating in the first"
msgstr "訂正發布最晚，應視為最高權威；它引用第九版即可切斷初版造成的循環"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.5.2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:129
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.5.2"
msgid ""
"The vanished queue verifies cancellation; continued admission merely shows "
"candidates ignored the notice"
msgstr "隊伍確實消失，足以驗證取消；門禁持續放行只表示考生沒有服從公告"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.5.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:130
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.5.3"
msgid ""
"The first edition accurately predicts the ninth and precedes it, so the "
"cycle counts as predictive replication in the dream and the correction as a "
"third time-ordered verification"
msgstr "初版準確預告第九版內容，具有時間先行性；可把循環視為夢境中的預測重現，訂正則算作依版本順序加權後的第三次時間驗證"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.7
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:133
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.5.PH-B03.7"
msgid ""
"Circular citations should be preserved, but repetition around a loop creates "
"no independent evidence. The gate log sits outside the loop and directly "
"measures admission."
msgstr "互相引用可以完整保存，卻不會憑循環次數產生獨立證據。門禁紀錄位於循環外，且直接測量實際放行狀態。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:139
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.3"
msgid ""
"[Two timetables for one student number]\nOfficial: TU-17 dropped BND-204 at "
"08:40.\nDream: TU-17 was automatically enrolled in BND-204 at the ninth "
"strike, room behind the original room.\nThe export tool currently "
"deduplicates only by student ID plus course code."
msgstr ""
"【同一學號的兩份課表】\n正式：TU-17 於 08:40 退選 BND-204。\n夢境：TU-17 於第九響自動選入 "
"BND-204，教室在原教室背面。\n匯出工具目前只以『學號＋課號』去除重複。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.4
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:140
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.4"
msgid "Which change prevents one record from being wrongly deleted?"
msgstr "哪一項修正能避免其中一份學籍被誤刪？"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.5.0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:142
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.5.0"
msgid ""
"Keep the newer dream enrolment because one student-course pair can have only "
"one current state"
msgstr "保留時間較新的夢境選課，因為同一學生同一課程只能有一個目前狀態"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.5.1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:143
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.5.1"
msgid ""
"Keep the official drop and convert dream enrolment to anonymous auditing "
"without a student ID"
msgstr "保留正式退選，將夢境選課轉成沒有學號的匿名旁聽，以免鍵值衝突"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.5.2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:144
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.5.2"
msgid ""
"Add boundary, branch/version, and effective time to the identity key; keep "
"the shared student-course link, but deduplicate only inside one validity "
"domain"
msgstr "把邊界、分支版本與生效時點加入身分鍵；同一學號與課號仍可連結，只在同一有效域內判斷重複"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.5.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:145
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.5.3"
msgid ""
"Merge enrolment and drop as 'status unknown,' retaining one record without "
"favouring either campus; leave both source times in a note and choose the "
"newer one wherever a downstream boolean is required"
msgstr "將選入與退選合併成『修課狀態不明』，如此只需保留一筆而不偏向任一校區；來源時間留在附註，下游若必須取得布林值則採較新一筆"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.7
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:148
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.6.PH-C01.7"
msgid ""
"A shared student ID identifies the person, not a shared validity world. "
"Deduplication must respect the boundary."
msgstr "學號相同只證明兩份紀錄談的是同一個人，不證明它們位於同一個有效世界。去重必須尊重邊界。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:154
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.3"
msgid ""
"[Untaken-route evaluation]\nThe candidate chose method A after judging the "
"case high-risk; official result: 62.\nThe dream simulates unchosen method B "
"on the same candidate and returns 91; B depends on a moonshadow variable "
"unobserved while awake.\nThe researcher claims 'B would improve the score by "
"29.'"
msgstr ""
"【未行路線評估】\n考生因預先判定高風險而採用方法 A；正式結果為 62 分。\n夢境以同一考生資料模擬未採用的方法 B，得到 91 分；B "
"的成功條件含一份醒著時未觀測的月影參數。\n研究者宣稱『改用 B 可提高 29 分』。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.4
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:155
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.4"
msgid "What is the soundest assessment and follow-up design?"
msgstr "最合理的評價與後續設計是？"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.5.0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:157
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.5.0"
msgid ""
"Using the same candidate removes individual differences, so 91−62 is B's "
"individual causal effect; moonshadow is merely a dream-runtime detail"
msgstr "同一考生消除了個體差異，91−62 可直接視為 B 的個體因果效果；月影參數只屬夢境執行細節，不影響方法比較"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.5.1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:158
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.5.1"
msgid ""
"The difference mixes selection, simulation, and an unobserved variable; "
"prospectively assign A/B within permitted paired dream replicas, preserve "
"parameters and versions, and never write back to the official score"
msgstr "目前差值混合選擇機制、模擬模型與未觀測參數；應在允許的夢境副本內前瞻配對分派 A/B，保存參數與版本，且不回寫正式分數"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.5.2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:159
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.5.2"
msgid ""
"Set moonshadow to the pooled mean, rerun across dream seeds for an interval, "
"and generalise to the ordinary campus if it remains near 29"
msgstr "把月影參數設成兩組平均值後重跑一次，並用多個夢境種子取得信賴區間；只要仍接近 29 分，即可外推普通校區"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.5.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:160
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.5.3"
msgid ""
"Because B was unchosen, further testing is unethical; retain model version, "
"selection reason, and the dream-descriptive 29, but build no identification "
"design"
msgstr "B 是未採用方案，倫理上不能再測；應保留模型版本、選擇理由與 29 分夢境描述差，但不另建可識別設計"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.7
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:163
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.7.PH-C02.7"
msgid ""
"The same person is not the same observable world-line. Selection and "
"unobserved moonshadow make 29 unidentified; the dream may improve design, "
"not manufacture a waking counterfactual."
msgstr "同一人不等於同一條可觀測世界線。未觀測月影與選擇原因使 29 分不可識別；夢境可以改善設計，不能替普通校區製造反事實。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:169
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.3"
msgid ""
"[Reverse capstone conditions]\n1. Six official records remain valid on the "
"ordinary campus.\n2. Six unchosen branches are each internally coherent in "
"the dream.\n3. One branch depends on a consumed paragraph; only its checksum "
"and two copies remain.\n4. Dream credits cannot enter the official "
"transcript.\n5. The purpose is to preserve what excluded proposals can teach, "
"not retry them."
msgstr ""
"【反面總卷條件】\n一、正式六份紀錄在普通校區仍有效。\n二、六條未選分支在夢境內各自自洽。\n三、其中一條依賴已被食夢的段落，只留校驗碼與兩份抄錄。\n四、夢"
"境學分不得轉入正式成績單。\n五、研究目的為保存被排除方案可教人的部分，不是替它們翻案。"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.4
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:170
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.4"
msgid "Which final ruling satisfies every condition?"
msgstr "哪一份總裁定同時滿足全部條件？"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.5.0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:172
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.5.0"
msgid ""
"Keep the six official outcomes externally valid; store six dream branches "
"separately with boundaries, provenance, and missingness mechanism; link "
"lessons to their source files without changing official conclusions or "
"transferring credit"
msgstr "維持正式六案的外部效力；另存六條夢境分支與邊界、來源及缺失機制；把可教訓部分連回原案，但不改正式結論、不轉學分"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.5.1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:173
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.5.1"
msgid ""
"Compare coherence, version completeness, and copy count case by case; "
"promote stronger dream branches to official corrections and transfer only "
"their dream credit"
msgstr "逐案比較自洽度、版本完整性與抄本數量；較完整的夢境分支升為正式訂正，其餘作附錄，夢學分只轉入升格案件"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.5.2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:174
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.5.2"
msgid ""
"Because official conclusions already exist, mark all dream material "
"inadmissible and keep the checksum, copies, and consumption event only in "
"private memory"
msgstr "正式紀錄既已有結論，夢境材料全部標作不可採信；校驗碼、兩份抄本與食夢事件只保留在考生個人記憶，不進任何共享檔案"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.5.3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:175
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.5.3"
msgid ""
"Merge front and reverse into one probability distribution, replace validity "
"boundaries with uncertainty, adjust posterior weights for provenance "
"completeness and dream-consumption risk, then post probability-weighted "
"dream credit officially"
msgstr "將正面與反面合成十二案的機率分布，以不確定度取代效力邊界；先依來源完整度與食夢風險校正後驗機率，再折算夢學分並登錄普通成績，表示部分有效"

#. phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.7
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:178
msgctxt "text:phantasmExamQuestions.8.PH-C03.7"
msgid ""
"The highest difficulty is not choosing one world. It keeps validity, "
"provenance, missingness, and pedagogical use separate, allowing the dream to "
"tell truths without impersonating the official ledger."
msgstr "最高難度不是選出唯一世界，而是把效力、來源、缺失與教育用途分開保存。夢境因此能說真話，同時沒有權力冒充正式帳本。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/eyebrow
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/eyebrow"
msgid "GKE-2026 / REVERSE-SIDE PAPER"
msgstr "GKE-2026 / REVERSE-SIDE PAPER"

#. phantasmExamCopy/title
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/title"
msgid "Gensokyo Unified Examination · PHANTASM Common Reverse Paper"
msgstr "幻想鄉統一學力試驗・PHANTASM 反面共同卷"

#. phantasmExamCopy/lead
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/lead"
msgid ""
"EXTRA follows versions and causes within one world-line. PHANTASM makes you "
"retain incompatible worlds at once without letting either steal the other's "
"authority."
msgstr "EXTRA 追問一條世界線中的版本與因果；PHANTASM 要你同時保存互不相容的世界，又不讓任何一邊偷換另一邊的效力。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/prerequisite
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/prerequisite"
msgid "Opening condition"
msgstr "開卷條件"

#. phantasmExamCopy/extraFound
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/extraFound"
msgid ""
"An ordinary-campus EXTRA submission seal shows through the paper. "
"Reverse-side text is authorised to appear."
msgstr "普通校區的 EXTRA 交卷章已透過紙面。反面試卷准予顯字。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/extraMissing
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/extraMissing"
msgid ""
"The sheet says only: Finish EXTRA first. Either track qualifies; the score "
"is not the threshold. Complete one whole world-line."
msgstr "紙面只寫著：先把 EXTRA 寫完。文科或理科皆可；分數不是門檻，完成一整條世界線才是。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/start
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/start"
msgid "Turn over and begin"
msgstr "翻到反面開卷"

#. phantasmExamCopy/resume
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/resume"
msgid "Resume reverse paper"
msgstr "繼續反面作答"

#. phantasmExamCopy/restart
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/restart"
msgid "Issue another reverse paper"
msgstr "另取一張反面卷"

#. phantasmExamCopy/records
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/records"
msgid "Dream attempt history"
msgstr "夢境歷次成績"

#. phantasmExamCopy/noRecords
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/noRecords"
msgid "No PHANTASM submission is stored. Ordinary Exams also denies printing this paper."
msgstr "尚無 PHANTASM 交卷記錄。正式校務處也表示從未印過這張卷。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/paper
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/paper"
msgid "Common reverse paper"
msgstr "反面共同卷"

#. phantasmExamCopy/instructions
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/instructions"
msgid "Candidate rules"
msgstr "應試規則"

#. phantasmExamCopy/rules/0
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/rules/0"
msgid ""
"Nine questions, three parts, 150 marks. Untimed: the ninth strike does not "
"promise to move forward."
msgstr "全卷九題、三部分、滿分 150 分；不限時，因第九響不承諾向前流動。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/rules/1
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/rules/1"
msgid ""
"Every item has one best answer. Contradictions may be retained, but cannot "
"entail claims outside their file."
msgstr "每題只有一個最合適答案；矛盾可以保留，但不得藉此推出與案卷無關的結論。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/rules/2
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/rules/2"
msgid ""
"Front and reverse may cite the same source; version, boundary, effective "
"time, and missingness mechanism remain distinct."
msgstr "正面與反面可引用同一來源，必須分別標示版本、邊界、生效時點與缺失機制。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/rules/3
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/rules/3"
msgid ""
"Drafts and results stay in dream files only. They never enter My TU, the "
"official transcript, or the campus event ledger."
msgstr "本卷草稿與成績只存於夢境檔案，不寫入 My TU、正式成績單或校園事件帳本。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/answered
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/answered"
msgid "Answered"
msgstr "已答"

#. phantasmExamCopy/points
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/points"
msgid "marks"
msgstr "分"

#. phantasmExamCopy/submit
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/submit"
msgid "Seal reverse answer sheet"
msgstr "封存反面答題紙"

#. phantasmExamCopy/submitConfirm
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/submitConfirm"
msgid "Some items are unanswered. A blank is evidence in PHANTASM too. Submit anyway?"
msgstr "仍有未作答題目；空白在 PHANTASM 也是一種資料。仍要交卷嗎？"

#. phantasmExamCopy/saved
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/saved"
msgid "Reverse answers saved in this device's dream files."
msgstr "反面答案已留在這台裝置的夢境檔案。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/result
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/result"
msgid "PHANTASM Reverse-Side Result"
msgstr "PHANTASM 反面成績紙"

#. phantasmExamCopy/score
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/score"
msgid "Dream score"
msgstr "夢境得分"

#. phantasmExamCopy/correct
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/correct"
msgid "Correct"
msgstr "答對"

#. phantasmExamCopy/excellent
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/excellent"
msgid "You retained two worlds without letting either impersonate the other."
msgstr "你保留了兩個世界，沒有讓任何一個冒充另一個。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/pass
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/pass"
msgid "The boundary mostly holds. Review where dream evidence slipped onto the front."
msgstr "邊界大致完整；回看失分題，找出哪一處把夢境證據偷偷送回正面。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/revise
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/revise"
msgid ""
"Separate validity, provenance, missingness, and causality before seating "
"contradictory files together."
msgstr "先分開效力、來源、缺失與因果，再讓互相矛盾的檔案同桌。"

#. phantasmExamCopy/review
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/review"
msgid "Item-by-item reverse annotations"
msgstr "逐題反面批註"

#. phantasmExamCopy/yourAnswer
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/yourAnswer"
msgid "Your answer"
msgstr "你的答案"

#. phantasmExamCopy/rightAnswer
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/rightAnswer"
msgid "Reverse reference answer"
msgstr "反面參考答案"

#. phantasmExamCopy/unanswered
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/unanswered"
msgid "Blank"
msgstr "留白"

#. phantasmExamCopy/back
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/back"
msgid "Back to reverse examination desk"
msgstr "返回反面試務桌"

#. phantasmExamCopy/printPaper
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/printPaper"
msgid "Print / save blank reverse paper"
msgstr "列印／另存空白反面卷"

#. phantasmExamCopy/printResult
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/printResult"
msgid "Print / save reverse result"
msgstr "列印／另存反面成績紙"

#. phantasmExamCopy/invalid
#: src/data/phantasm-exam.js:182
msgctxt "tree:phantasmExamCopy#/invalid"
msgid "Not valid outside the dream boundary"
msgstr "Not valid outside the dream boundary"
